./design/sources/platform/knowledge.pen:466910:          "content": "Contextual Help: RAG Status Tooltip\n\nPattern: Info icon next to column header with tooltip on hover.\n\nWhat was added:\n- Info icon (i) next to 'RAG status' column header\n- Tooltip on hover: 'Shows if this document is ready for AI search'\n\nWhy this approach:\n- Zero visual clutter by default\n- Explains jargon ('RAG status') at the point of confusion\n- Uses existing tooltip component\n- Short, scannable copy — not a paragraph\n- Positioned below the icon it refers to\n- Narrow width with text wrapping"
